pad_latch_16b: "Distributed bidirectional 16b pad-ring latch LH[7:0]:LL[7:0] w/ local CLK_14M dual-edge 0.5Q DDS_L/H generator (~3-5ns dead-band), A0-steered /WE_L//WE_H & DL/RDATA byte-lane mux; DL directly triggers PLA decode"
