canonical_bipolar_scratchpad:
chip: "Single-chip 7489 / 82S25 (16x4 bipolar TTL RAM, DIP-16, open-collector /O tied to D via 1-2.2k pull-ups)"
pins_and_timing: "9 CPU pins (SA[3:0]->A0-A3, SAD[3:0]<->D0-D3//O0-O3, /SWE->/WE, /CE=GND); 0 glue/latches (0ns RD<->WR); 0.5Q=35.24ns/nibble -> 1 byte/0.25T (1Q), 16b shadow reg pair/0.5T (1H)"
speed_evolution: "7489/82S25 (1971-77, 35-50ns) -> 74S189/289 (1975-80, 35ns max) -> 74F189/289 FAST (1981-82, 25-28ns, 4-5MHz octal-T) -> 74F189A/F219A non-inv (1984-85, 8-12ns, 8-12MHz octal-T)"
