- "1x 74LS166 (7.0 MHz 8-bit pixel serializer) + 1x 74LS374 (attribute latch) + 1x 74LS157 + 1x 74LS86 (INK/PAPER mux + FLASH XOR)"
- "2x 74LS157 (Row/Col address muxes interleaving CRTC & Z80 on opposite 140ns half-cycles = 0 CPU contention) + 1x 74LS245 (VRAM data transceiver)"
- "1x Intel 8255 PPI (Keyboard matrix row/col scan + BORDER + MIC/EAR/BEEPER + 3-bit 128K-512K bank select)"
- "1x 74S189 / 74F189 (16x4 dynamic raster-reprogrammable CLUT palette) + 1x 74LS138 (3-to-8 MMIO decoder)"
