"3F00h-3F01h": "MC6845 CRTC Register Select & Data (mid-raster scroll/geometry updates)"
"3F10h-3F13h": "Intel 8255 PPI: Port A (3F10h, K0-K4 + EAR in), Port B (3F11h, 8 kbd row outs decoupled from A8-A15), Port C (3F12h, PC0-2 BORDER, PC3 MIC, PC4 BEEPER, PC5-7 3-bit RAM/ROM bank select)"
"3F20h-3F2Fh": "74S189 / 74F189 16x4 Hardware CLUT (LDIR per-scanline palette reloads)"
"3F30h-3F3Fh": "Raster-line IRQ compare & shadow screen page-flip control (4000h vs C000h)"
bus_arbitration:
topology: "Odd-Even 2T ULA/CPU Crossbar (1T VDP + 1T CPU = 80 active turns/line each; VDP burst-steal up to 160 turns/line in RGB332/RGB565); single unified /RAS exposed to active side; VDP drives CROSSBAR_ODD_EVEN directly"
crossbar_bom_5ic: "CPU-side 3 ICs (1x 74F245 AD[7:0] + 1x 74F125 A8/A9//WE_L//WE_H + 1x 74F02 VIRT_EN/OE) + VDP-side 2 ICs (1x 74F245 + 1x 74F125); 5-7ns delay; +$4.15..+$6.60 gross retail bump"
legacy_slave: "Symmetric FCFS /WAIT arbiter w/ LAST_WINNER FF; BYTE_MODE=1 steers A0; Master=/INT, Slave=/NMI"
ula_mmio: "0 /IORQ ports; MMIO +0x7F0..7F7 KBD, +0x7F8 ULA_CFG, +0x7F9 BEEPER_MIC, +0x7FA EAR_IN, +0x7FB SYS_STATUS"
memory_map: "0x0000-3FFF Mask ROM/2x2764 + 16KB shadow RAM | 0x4000 VDP FONT_BASE + coupled [CHAR,ATTR] words (or contended RAM) | 0x8000+ User RAM (64KB default, up to 1MB linear); DRAMs: 4116..41256, 4416..44256, KR565RU3..7"
